00:14:47.710 --> 00:14:49.330 line:78% position:50% align:center size:90%
Bring your notes: your range,

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:50.950 line:78% position:50% align:center size:90%
your gaps and your stop rule.

00:14:51.192 --> 00:14:52.414 line:78% position:50% align:center size:90%
Keep the word Example

00:14:52.414 --> 00:14:53.839 line:78% position:50% align:center size:90%
on every practice figure.

00:14:54.359 --> 00:14:56.315 line:78% position:50% align:center size:90%
